  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "u09-1",
      "title": "Who, where, when, why, how much",
      "explanation": [
        "You already know **wat** (what) and **hoe** (how).",
        "**wie** = who, **waar** = where, **wanneer** = when, **hoekom** = why, **hoeveel** = how much / how many.",
        "The question word comes first, then the verb: **Waar is die badkamer?**",
        "**kos** = to cost (it also means *food*). **begin** = start."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Waar is die badkamer?",
          "en": "Where is the bathroom?"
        },
        {
          "af": "Wanneer begin die skool?",
          "en": "When does school start?"
        },
        {
          "af": "Hoekom is jy moeg?",
          "en": "Why are you tired?"
        },
        {
          "af": "Hoeveel kos dit?",
          "en": "How much does it cost?"
        }
      ],
      "vocab": [
        "wie",
        "waar",
        "wanneer",
        "hoekom",
        "hoeveel",
        "badkamer",
        "begin",
        "kos"
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
